#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B2F/scripts.inc:89
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B2F_Text_MattIntro"
msgid ""
"Hehehe…\p"
"Got here already, did you?\n"
"We underestimated you!\p"
"But this is it!\p"
"I'm a cut above the GRUNTS you've seen\n"
"so far.\p"
"I'm not stalling for time.\n"
"I'm going to pulverize you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B2F/scripts.inc:99
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B2F_Text_MattDefeat"
msgid ""
"Hehehe…\n"
"So, I lost, too…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B2F/scripts.inc:103
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B2F_Text_OurBossGotThroughHisPreparations"
msgid ""
"Hehehe!\p"
"While I was toying with you, our BOSS\n"
"got through his preparations!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B2F/scripts.inc:108
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B2F_Text_MattPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Hehehe!\p"
"Our BOSS has already gone on his way to\n"
"some cave under the sea!\p"
"If you're going to give chase, you'd\n"
"better search the big, wide sea beyond\l"
"LILYCOVE.\p"
"But will you find it then?\n"
"Hehehe!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B2F/scripts.inc:118
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B2F_Text_Grunt4Intro"
msgid ""
"Wahahah, I grew weary of waiting!\n"
"You owe me a battle, too!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B2F/scripts.inc:122
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B2F_Text_Grunt4Defeat"
msgid ""
"Tired of waiting…\n"
"Lost and dazed…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B2F/scripts.inc:126
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B2F_Text_Grunt4PostBattle"
msgid ""
"BOSS…\n"
"Is this good enough?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B2F/scripts.inc:130
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B2F_Text_Grunt6Intro"
msgid ""
"Warp panels, the HIDEOUT's pride\n"
"and joy!\p"
"You're clueless about where you are,\n"
"aren't you?\p"
"Fluster and tire out the enemy, then\n"
"lower the boom! That's our plan!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B2F/scripts.inc:138
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B2F_Text_Grunt6Defeat"
msgid ""
"What's wrong with you?\n"
"You're not tired at all!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B2F/scripts.inc:142
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B2F_Text_Grunt6PostBattle"
msgid ""
"That reminds me… I can't remember\n"
"where I put the MASTER BALL.\p"
"If I fail to guard it, our BOSS will\n"
"chew me out…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B2F/scripts.inc:148
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B2F_Text_Grunt8Intro"
msgid ""
"When I joined TEAM AQUA, the first\n"
"thing I had to learn was how these\l"
"warp panels connected.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B2F/scripts.inc:153
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B2F_Text_Grunt8Defeat"
msgid ""
"I was too occupied thinking about\n"
"the warp panels…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B2F/scripts.inc:157
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B2F_Text_Grunt8PostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'll have to learn about how I can\n"
"battle more effectively…$"
msgstr ""
